Here we go. Here's some pens for you

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:48.320
people. My colleagues.

00:05:46.639 --> 00:05:50.160
>> Yes, please. [laughter] Come on. Come on

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:52.720
over.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:54.960
Come on over.

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:57.280
My guys, they don't. They have enough.

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:59.199
They have enough of these.

00:05:57.280 --> 00:06:02.639
Please take them.

00:05:59.199 --> 00:06:06.280
>> Do you have any questions, please?

00:06:02.639 --> 00:06:06.280
Do you have any questions?

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:13.360
>> It's a joint statement agreement between

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:17.280
United States of America, the Kingdom of

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:19.360
Thailand uh on reciprocal trade. It's a

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:21.759
very big actually it's a very big trade

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:23.520
deal.

00:06:21.759 --> 00:06:27.319
Okay.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:27.319
Thank you very much everybody.

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:34.080
Thank you once again very much. Thank

00:06:30.479 --> 00:06:35.120
you so much. Any let me know.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.759
>> Thank you. Okay.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:39.720
